graph LR
    EvalHub["eval-hub<br/>1.0.4"]

    %% External Dependencies
    EvalHub -->|Jobs, ConfigMaps, Secrets,<br/>NetworkPolicies, pod logs| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>client-go v0.37.2"]
    EvalHub -->|persistence, optional| PG["PostgreSQL<br/>pgx v5.12.0"]
    EvalHub -->|default storage| SQLite["SQLite<br/>modernc v1.61.1"]
    EvalHub -.->|queue labels, optional| Kueue["Kueue LocalQueue<br/>kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1"]
    EvalHub -.->|telemetry, optional| OTLP["OTLP Collector<br/>otel v1.47.0"]
    EvalHub -->|artifacts| OCI["OCI Registry"]

    %% Job-pod external services
    EvalHub -->|init: test data| S3["S3 storage<br/>aws-sdk-go-v2"]
    EvalHub -->|init: test data| Git["Git server<br/>go-git v5.19.3"]
    EvalHub -->|init: test data| HF["Hugging Face Hub<br/>go-huggingface v0.4.3"]
    EvalHub -->|sidecar: inference| Models["Model / judge endpoints"]

    %% Internal RHOAI Dependencies
    EvalHub -->|auth front door| KRP["kube-rbac-proxy"]
    EvalHub -.->|experiment tracking, optional| MLflow["MLflow<br/>mlflow-go"]
    EvalHub -->|Job resource sizing| HWP["ODH HardwareProfile<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io/v1"]
    EvalHub -->|runs benchmarks| Adapters["Provider adapter images<br/>lm-eval, garak, ragas,<br/>lighteval, guidellm, ..."]
    EvalHub -->|CA bundle| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]

    %% Integration Points (inbound)
    Operator["trustyai-service-operator"] -->|deploys + configures| EvalHub
    Dashboard["RHOAI Dashboard"] -->|REST API| EvalHub
    SDK["eval-hub-sdk"] -->|REST API| EvalHub
    MCP["evalhub-mcp"] -->|REST API| EvalHub
    Prom["Prometheus"] -->|scrape 8081| EvalHub

